Crucial Next Steps for You:

   1. Physical Wiring Change: You must physically disconnect the VCC wire of
      your Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor from the Red rail (3.3V) and connect
      it instead to GPIO16 on your ESP32. The GND and Signal (OUT) wires should
      remain connected to the Blue rail (GND) and GPIO34 respectively.

   2. Re-upload `HW_code.ino`: Upload the modified HW_code.ino sketch to your
      ESP32.

   3. Monitor Serial Output: Open the Serial Monitor in Arduino IDE (at 115200
      baud).

  Please observe the serial output carefully. I am particularly interested in:
   * Whether the [BH1750] ERROR: other error still appears.
   * Whether the "Guru Meditation Error" or any other crashes occur.
   * The output from the Serial.println statements I added, which will show the
     progress of setup() and sensor readings.

  Report the full serial output again after performing these steps.
